<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cymer Inc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cymer Inc started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Brett Hodess said he initiated coverage of Cymer Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- He said he expected the company to earn $0.36 per share in the fiscal year ended December 1996 and $0.80 in fiscal 1997. His target price is $30, or 43 percent above current levels.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-5/8 at 24-3/8.</p>
</text>
